WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.860
In the end Americans do not like to be manipulated,

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.730
they do not like to be spied on,

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.500
we don't like it when someone is outside of
our home watching.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:20.200
Let's just let that silence hang in the air.

